      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "確認。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "確認なら、行くか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……うん。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "美空は？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "美空は売り場。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "誘わなくていいのか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "今回は……店長に用があるって言ったでしょ。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "言ってたな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "繰り返さなくていい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "悪い。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "謝らなくていい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――夜空は売り場の方をちらりと見る。\n美空は少し離れた場所で、展示棚を整えていた。\nこちらに気づくと、にこっと笑って小さく手を振る。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "行ってらっしゃい、夜空。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……行ってらっしゃいじゃない。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "ふふっ。\nでも、行くんでしょ？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "確認に行くだけ。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "うん。\n確認、大事だね。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "美空は、そういうところがずるい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "今日はわたしもずるい担当？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "うん。\n最近、店長に似てきた。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "俺の影響か。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "悪影響。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "じゃあ、悪影響を受けた美空は売り場を見てますね。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……本当に、まっすぐすぎる。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "夜空は考えすぎ。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "何回でも言うね。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "美空",
      "text": "何回でも言うよ。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ah",
          "src": "images/assets/char/h10202.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――夜空は少しだけ顔をそらし、店長より先に歩き出した。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――ひだまりストア前――",
      "bg": "images/assets/bg/bg_hidamari_store_front_evening.png",
      "bgMode": "forceReplace",
      "forceBackgroundReplace": true
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "自販機は、店の横でよかったか？",
      "bg": "images/assets/bg/bg_hidamari_store_front_winter_day.png",
      "bgMode": "cover",
      "forceBackgroundReplace": true,
      "clearStorySprites": true
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "うん。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "ココア、あるといいな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "なかったら、別にいい。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そうなのか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "確認だから。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "飲みたいわけじゃなくて？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "……。",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ai",
          "src": "images/assets/char/i10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "悪い。\n余計だったな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "夜空",
      "text": "余計。\nでも……半分くらいは、飲んでもいいと思ってる。",
